{"id": "951_gameover_ruined|gameover-ruined-01-start|T25", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You park in front of your building. Someone taps on your window. You look over and see your boss.", "passage": "gameover-ruined-01-start", "source": "textasset", "es": "Estacionas frente a tu edificio. Alguien golpea tu ventana. Miras y ves a tu jefe.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "951_gameover_ruined|gameover-ruined-01-start|T26", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "He gets into the back seat, expressionless.", "passage": "gameover-ruined-01-start", "source": "textasset", "es": "Se sube al asiento trasero, sin expresión.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "951_gameover_ruined|gameover-ruined-01-start|T27", "type": "CHOICE", "en": "« There a problem, boss? »", "passage": "gameover-ruined-01-start", "link": "gameover-ruined-01-problem", "source": "textasset", "es": "« ¿Hay algún problema, jefe? »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "951_gameover_ruined|gameover-ruined-01-start|T28", "type": "CHOICE", "en": "« Everything ok? »", "passage": "gameover-ruined-01-start", "link": "gameover-ruined-01-problem", "source": "textasset", "es": "« ¿Todo bien? »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "951_gameover_ruined|gameover-ruined-01-start|T29", "type": "CHOICE", "en": "(Say nothing.)", "passage": "gameover-ruined-01-start", "emote": ":silence:", "link": "gameover-ruined-01-silence", "source": "textasset", "es": "(No decir nada.)", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "951_gameover_ruined|gameover-ruined-01-problem|T33", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« I don’t know how to say this… but… »", "passage": "gameover-ruined-01-problem", "speaker": "BOSS", "source": "textasset", "es": "« No sé cómo decir esto… pero… »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "951_gameover_ruined|gameover-ruined-01-silence|T38", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "He sighs slowly.", "passage": "gameover-ruined-01-silence", "source": "textasset", "es": "Suspira lentamente.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "951_gameover_ruined|gameover-ruined-01-silence|T39", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« You don't have a single euro left at the bank, what the… What the fuck did you do? »", "passage": "gameover-ruined-01-silence", "speaker": "BOSS", "source": "textasset", "es": "« No te queda ni un euro en el banco, qué… ¿Qué mierda hiciste? »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "951_gameover_ruined|gameover-ruined-01-silence|T40", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "« I’m going to pay it off… »", "passage": "gameover-ruined-01-silence", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Voy a pagarlo… »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "951_gameover_ruined|gameover-ruined-01-silence|T41", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« No. It’s too late… Sorry, but… I have no choice I need… »", "passage": "gameover-ruined-01-silence", "speaker": "BOSS", "source": "textasset", "es": "« No. Ya es tarde… Lo siento, pero… No tengo opción, necesito… »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "951_gameover_ruined|gameover-ruined-01-silence|T42", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« I need you to turn over your taxi and permit. That’s just the way it is. »", "passage": "gameover-ruined-01-silence", "speaker": "BOSS", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Necesito que entregues tu taxi y tu licencia. Así son las cosas. »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "951_gameover_ruined|gameover-ruined-01-silence|T43", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "Your head is spinning. You can barely hear your boss’ voice.", "passage": "gameover-ruined-01-silence", "source": "textasset", "es": "Tu cabeza da vueltas. Apenas puedes oír la voz de tu jefe.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "951_gameover_ruined|gameover-ruined-01-silence|T44", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "A few minutes later, your taxi starts without you in it. Soon, the police… Busset…", "passage": "gameover-ruined-01-silence", "source": "textasset", "es": "Unos minutos después, tu taxi arranca sin ti dentro. Pronto, la policía… Busset…", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "951_gameover_ruined|gameover-ruined-01-silence|T45", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "Your face will be in all the papers. All of France will be convinced you’re the killer.", "passage": "gameover-ruined-01-silence", "source": "textasset", "es": "Tu cara estará en todos los periódicos. Toda Francia estará convencida de que eres el asesino.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "951_gameover_ruined|gameover-ruined-01-silence|T46", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You’re fucked…", "passage": "gameover-ruined-01-silence", "source": "textasset", "es": "Estás jodido…", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "951_gameover_ruined|gameover-ruined-01-silence|T48", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "Fucked…", "passage": "gameover-ruined-01-silence", "source": "textasset", "es": "Jodido…", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
